cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Loggetta: plan and run Mixture-of-Experts fine-tuning on one GPU"
abstract: >-
  Check the machine, plan a supported configuration for a Mixture-of-Experts
  model, run QLoRA fine-tuning, and keep a JSON report of each run. Built on
  experts4bit-qlora (runtime) and grouped-nf4-gemm (kernels).
authors:
